{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46649","headline":"荆州新秋病起杂题一十五首 病起见生涯 · 齐己","name":"荆州新秋病起杂题一十五首 病起见生涯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病起见生涯，资缘觉甚奢。\n方袍嫌垢弊，律服变光华。\n颇愧同诸俗，何尝异出家。\n三衣如两翼，珍重汝寒鸦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46649.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46649","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}